{"text": "When morning came, the correspondent saw a tall wind tower on the shore, standing with its back to the tiny men like a giant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nature, he thought, was neither cruel nor kind, nor wise, but simply indifferent to the struggles of men. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Fearing that they would soon be too weak, the captain decided to take the boat through the surf at once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A great wave crashed over them, the boat turned over, and the four men were thrown into the icy water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The oiler swam strongly ahead, the cook floated on his back with an oar, and the captain held on to the overturned boat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The correspondent was caught in a current that held him back, but at last a big wave threw him safely toward the beach. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a man from the shore ran into the water and pulled the cook to land, and the captain sent him on to the correspondent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> On the sand lay the oiler, his face turned down to the beach, and he would never row again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night the white waves moved in the moonlight, and the wind carried the seas great voice to the three men on shore, who felt that they could now be its interpreters.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", ",", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "r", "r", "e", "s", "p", "o", "n", "d", "e", "n", "t", " ", "s", "a", "w", " ", "a", " ", "t", "a", "l", "l", " ", "w", "i", "n", "d", " ", "t", "o", "w", "e", "r", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "h", "o", "r", "e", ",", " ", "s", "t", "a", "n", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "i", "t", "s", " ", "b", "a", "c", "k", " ", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "i", "n", "y", " ", "m", "e", "n", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "g", "i", "a", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0",